<title>LATVIA: TILTI SAYS IN '96 PROFIT OF 121,044 LATS.</title>
<headline>TILTI SAYS IN '96 PROFIT OF 121,044 LATS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvijas tilti (Latvian Bridges) made a 1996 profit of 121,044 lats on net turnover of 2.76 million lats, the stock exchange said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Latvian Bridges is a secondary list stock of the Riga stock exchange.</p>
<p>The bourse said in a statement that Latvian Bridges gross profit came to 302,179 lats, administrative expenses were 103,942 lats and that the profit before tax was 199,266 lats.</p>
<p>The bourse also said that Bridges had assets of 1.29 million lats. No comparative figures for 1995 were provided.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
